                                                "sense_id": "6887fa3a-ed71-3e5e-a1b3-f7077ad1c09c",
                                                "text": "Buttonhole row: (K1, p1) 3 times, yon, k2tog, (k1,p1) 5 times, yon, k2tog, […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
